  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tiqc](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tiqc) Magnitude 6.4 earthquake at 104.329 depth occurred on Sep 20 2026 23km S of Guhu. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -5.9021 longitude 146.0922. It impacted 132076 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
